,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-05-06T00:59:11Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T14:09:21Z","closed_at":"2025-05-06T13:50:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106114","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106114","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106114.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106114.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-06T13:50:51Z"},"body":"This PR adds a property to `LineEdit` and `TextEdit` to control whether the virtual keyboard (on platforms that support it) should show on focus events.\r\n\r\nThe second commit leverages the new property to disable showing the virtual keyboard on focus events for the following editor components:\r\n- Code editor: In the Android editor, this would cause the virtual keyboard to show on start if the script editor was left as the last selected workspace\r\n- Project settings' search bar: Opening the project settings in the Android editor would always show the virtual keyboard regardless of the user's intent\r\n- Editor settings' search: Same behavior as the project settings, this would always cause the virtual keyboard to show regarless of the user's intent\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106114/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106114/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}